{"v":4,"catch":"用生命守護總部！","desc":"《Tank Battalion》是NAMCO（Bandai Namco Entertainment Inc.）於1980年發行的射擊遊戲。\n在《BATTLE CITY》和《TANK FORCE》的前作中，玩家控制一輛坦克，為保護總部免受敵人的襲擊而戰鬥。\n近距離正面擊倒敵人會獲得更多積分，因此危險的攻擊成為獲得高分的關鍵。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。\n\n*選項菜單和手冊有日語，英語，法語，德語，意大利語和西班牙語。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2024-03-07","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d75c43d0d04fcf6156648b94df42775019a5ef3e8c499fca0057dd8669615549.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bb550052377a91d38a556e62cdce7c07f83584050d326a65b366785dfb71441c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a798d7d208607cf2d99d37ab694a27ca7a2b920aa0c333d0143e491a6dfa73dd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eb56aba9d5d4a76a9962a6d90e5c29b1588d6faf43eb4f03f9f09b88a5ab9ea9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/96af2dfb25bf2aa304db5e37ea18d1f935f36f403b34db0c75057fcf50fb4262.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cf00b592682277924095e6923110c7584189d29bee42c1a4a0b4061de11bb755.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c0301af9a000","dlc":[]}